# Phase 4's verify tour: an exterior, the inventory, map, journal and race menus, a save and its load (a loading screen),
# a worldspace change (Blackreach) and the race menu last (it stays open: no save works after it), with shots, VRAM snapshots and texture totals. Run it with no switches for the
# reference, and with -Env CS_ORG_TRIPWIRE_GUEST=1 and the Phase 4 switches for the port.
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;700:coc Whiterun;1500:dclf:shot=whiterun;1501:dclf:vram-json;1502:dclf:tex-stats;1600:dclf:menu=InventoryMenu=show;1800:dclf:shot=inventory;1850:dclf:menu=InventoryMenu=hide;1950:dclf:menu=MapMenu=show;2200:dclf:shot=map;2250:dclf:menu=MapMenu=hide;2350:dclf:menu=Journal Menu=show;2500:dclf:shot=journal;2550:dclf:menu=Journal Menu=hide;2700:dclf:save=p4tour;2800:dclf:load=recent;3500:dclf:shot=loaded;3600:cow Blackreach 0 0;4400:dclf:shot=blackreach;4401:dclf:vram-json;4402:dclf:tex-stats;4500:showracemenu;4750:dclf:shot=racemenu
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=4800
